.TH RNG_CHANCE 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
rng_chance \- True with probability p (0..1): rng_chance(&g\->rng, 0.25f) is a one\-in\-four drop
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqrng.h\(dq
.BI "bool rng_chance(uint64_t *s, float p);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
True with probability p (0..1): rng_chance(&g\->rng, 0.25f) is a one\-in\-four drop.
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH RETURN VALUE
true p of the time.
